### Top-level fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `start` / `end` | Instant | Resolved window |
| `total` | number | Matching documents (all pages) |
| `page` / `size` | number | Resolved pagination |
| `items` | `AdminOtpUnverifiedItem[]` | Current page |

### Item fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `userId` | string | `auth_info` id |
| `phone` | string \| null | Call this number |
| `lastOtpRequestedAt` | Instant \| null | When they last hit request OTP |
| `otpVerifiedAt` | Instant \| null | Last successful verify (null or older than request) |
| `lastOtpFailedAt` | Instant \| null | Last failed verify attempt |
| `otpAttempts` | number | Failed attempts counter (reset on success) |
| `lastOtpChannel` | string \| null | e.g. `SMS` / `WHATSAPP` |
| `profileRegistered` | boolean | Already completed registration before |
| `blocked` | boolean | Temporarily blocked after too many failed OTPs |
| `blockedUntil` | Instant \| null | Block expiry |
| `accountStatus` | string \| null | Usually `ACTIVE` |

