## Suggested UI

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Date range  [Last 7 days ▾]     Total unverified: 87       │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Phone | Requested at | Failed at | Attempts | Registered │
│ +91…  | 25 Sep 18:22 | 18:23     | 2        | No         │
│ [Call]                                                 │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

1. Load with default 7-day window.
2. Show `phone` as primary action (Click-to-call / copy).
3. Use `lastOtpFailedAt` + `otpAttempts` to prioritize “tried and failed” vs “never entered OTP”.
4. If `blocked`, note they may be in a temporary OTP lockout.

